### Lista testelor
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teste

### Cautare dupa titlu
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teste?cautare=java

### Creare test (autorId 1 = Profesor Test din V2) -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teste
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titlu": "Java de baza",
  "descriere": "Intrebari introductive",
  "domeniu": "Programare",
  "durataMinute": 20,
  "autorId": 1
}

### Detaliu test -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teste/1

### Modificare test -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/teste/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titlu": "Java de baza (v2)",
  "descriere": "Intrebari introductive",
  "domeniu": "Programare",
  "durataMinute": 25,
  "autorId": 1
}

### Adaugare intrebare -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teste/1/intrebari
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Ce cuvant cheie creeaza un obiect?",
  "punctaj": 2,
  "variante": [
    { "text": "new", "corecta": true },
    { "text": "create", "corecta": false }
  ]
}

### Modificare intrebare -> 200 (variantele se inlocuiesc complet)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/intrebari/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Ce operator creeaza un obiect in Java?",
  "punctaj": 3,
  "variante": [
    { "text": "new", "corecta": true },
    { "text": "malloc", "corecta": false },
    { "text": "make", "corecta": false }
  ]
}

### EROARE 400: nicio varianta corecta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teste/1/intrebari
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Intrebare gresita",
  "punctaj": 1,
  "variante": [
    { "text": "a", "corecta": false },
    { "text": "b", "corecta": false }
  ]
}

### EROARE 400: autorul e student (id 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teste
Content-Type: application/json

{ "titlu": "X", "domeniu": "Y", "durataMinute": 10, "autorId": 2 }

### EROARE 400: validare @Valid (titlu gol, durata 0)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teste
Content-Type: application/json

{ "titlu": "", "domeniu": "Y", "durataMinute": 0, "autorId": 1 }

### EROARE 404: test inexistent
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teste/999

### Stergere intrebare -> 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/intrebari/1

### Stergere test -> 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/teste/1
